      "comment": "CONQUER DAT (1) returned with a solid second at Gatton over 860m after being prominent at the corner. Fitter for that run and will be tough to beat. IGOTMYMINDONYOU (2) is back after a break of four months. At the last run before the layoff he finished sixth over 1000m at Eagle Farm. Impressive winner of a recent trial at Dalby. No surprise if he was able to get off the mark. LOVE AND PAIN (3) is a locally trained maiden galloper who hasn't raced since finishing 6 lengths back in sixth over 1000m at Murray Bridge ten months ago. Fitter for a recent trial win. Should be involved in the finish. KISKABOOM (7) showed some ability in first campaign and sure to be improved. SALUKI (9) is returning from a spell of nine weeks. Finished seventh at Sunshine Coast over 1000m at the first run last prep. Now with a new trainer Ravyn Warzecha. Worth watching for a move.",
